From ca765a4d10070f424a64a47a06385df8ddcc1b45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:58:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(accounts): profiles, username_reservations,
 user_settings with RLS lock-down

- apps/accounts: three tables as approved (username rules, role/status, settings)
- migrations: 0001 tables and CHECK constraints, 0002 database foreign keys
  (auth.users -> profiles -> user_settings / username_reservations),
  0003 Row Level Security on, no policies, public-role privileges revoked
- common/ownership.py: for_user(principal) manager; common/db.py: lock_down_table
- tests: 80 new tests incl. database cascade on Supabase user deletion and
  guards that fail when a model forgets OWNER_FIELD or a table forgets RLS
- database tests run when QEEVA_TEST_DATABASE_URL is set, else are skipped

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
